p Dear #{@user.decorate.full_name},
p The following report has been approved.

p Project: #{@user_report.project.name}
p Campaign: #{@user_report.campaign.name}
p Report: #{@user_report.report.name}
p Candidate: #{@user_report.user.decorate.full_name}

p You are receiving this email as you have been added as the contact to receive report approval notification for the above mentioned report.

p You can access the report via the following link.

= link_to 'Report', administration_to_admin_url(@url)
